Package: 67
Version: 1.5.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: 67 contributors <67@localhost>
Depends: chafa (>= 1.12.0), zsh (>= 5.8)
Description: Play the 67 GIF animation in the terminal
 A small shell command that displays an animated GIF using Chafa.
 Run 67 from any directory. A temporary Zsh session shows a pixel-art cat GIF
 above the prompt. Commands are typed on the next line below the animation.
 Run 67 --stop to hide the animation, or exit to return to your shell.
